    "body": "﻿Merged upstream main again (108b1e76) to resolve a new conflict: upstream's plasma work (#670) added `ToolKind::Torch` and a `PT-KERF-150` row to the Rust catalog table this PR replaces. Resolution: the asset read stays; the torch row moves into `assets/tools/catalog.json` (torch_tool(1.5)'s values); the asset reader learns the `torch` kind; `the_json_catalog_keeps_the_old_tables_values` now also pins `PT-KERF-150` against `torch_tool(1.5)`, and the order list grows to 29. `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` takes main's. Diff against main is still the PR's own 9 files.\n\nGate on 108b1e76: camcraft-tools 38 lib (3 catalog_asset_tests) + headless_bin 3 passed; app cutting_data, mcp, plasma_machine, plasma_profile, tool_after_state, tool_body, tool_body_view, tool_csys, tool_gate, tool_law, tool_library, tool_list, tool_numbers, tool_spun_profile all passed (0 failed); ui lib 454 passed, 5 ignored (snapshots); clippy -p camcraft-tools -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -D warnings clean.\r\n",
